Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing! I'm definitely\Ngonna wear a scarf tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets pretty cold in the evenings now, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Don't you go\Nstealing {\i1}my {\i0}Miyamura, Tanihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not stealing him from you, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are so weird! You're always\Ncuddling with each other and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, but that's all it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kinda gotten close lately, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell do you mean, you've gotten close?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Closer than {\i1}just friends{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please. I'm not Shindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, really? Is that\Nwhat Shindo-kun is to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Creak..."\NW-Wait, really? Is that\Nwhat Shindo-kun is to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Trembling"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"Creak..."\NW-Wait, really? Is that\Nwhat Shindo-kun is to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Trembling"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, really? Is that\Nwhat Shindo-kun is to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Trembling"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Tanihara, spill the damn beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I saw Shindo go over to\NMiyamura's to get a change of clothes once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he stays over at my place a lot!\NEven when I don't want him to!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A wild Shindo appears!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you guys blockin' the\Nsidewalk? What's goin' on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shindo-kun, are you close with Chika-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda? Though lately,\Nshe's been busy studying for exams,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.66,0:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so we haven't hung out much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I've spent plenty\Nof nights at Miyamura's!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"* Playing video games."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I've spent plenty\Nof nights at Miyamura's!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I've spent plenty\Nof nights at Miyamura's!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:01:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shindo, let's go get some Mickey D's!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't spell "burger"\Nwithout Shindo, am I right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Makes no sense, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that free coffee coupon still good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, I just want you\Nto know something, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about {\i1}girls{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.83,0:02:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I think about\Nsome {\i1}guy {\i0}taking you, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking me {\i1}how{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me this! If you fall for\Nsomeone else, it better be a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No guys, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So I had to promise her "no guys" yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys need to stay away from me, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.33,0:02:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but... what about when\Nyou need to use the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just won't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is my day off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've gone shopping\Nfor art supplies by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Until the Snow Melts"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've gone shopping\Nfor art supplies by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Until the Snow Melts"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hit up the bookstore, too.\NI can't carry everything by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Until the Snow Melts"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you could just go to\Nthe bookstore another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Yoshikawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagi-kun? Whoa, you're wearing glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was you. What're you shopping for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, books and stuff, but mostly art supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Art supplies? I didn't know you\Nwere an artist, Yoshikawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're not for me, they're for my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Stare"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you, I'm Akane Yanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise. Didn't know Yuki was\Nfriends with a hottie like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you're her {\i1}boyfriend{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am. She turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured. You wouldn't date--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she turned you down?!\NNot the other way around?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm far out of her league.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yuki's league? {\i1}This {\i0}Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You let this high-class meal go to waste?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You let this high-class meal go to waste?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop looking at me like that!\NI hear you loud and clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"You let this high-class meal go to waste?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my sister's such an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. This was a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined being able\Nto speak to you outside of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I shouldn't say that,\Nor Ishikawa-kun will get mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he wouldn't. You're a good guy, Yanagi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru wouldn't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear those two are dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really? I thought so!\NThey {\i1}are {\i0}always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.79,0:06:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They make a good couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that Kono-san is totally fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fooled?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kono-san thinks Toru and I are dating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she? I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She sorta asked me about it yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and I told her we were dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't I just tell her the truth?\NWhat's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want to talk to me\Nto see if I'd tell her the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay quiet about it if you admit\Nthat you have a crush on Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's not fair about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one being unfair, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right. This isn't fair to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied to Kono-san, knowing it would hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never seen someone's lips\Ntremble like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi-chan, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Toru doesn't like me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We should've stopped\Npretending that very same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But he holds my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nice to me, even when I don't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I asked you to keep up\Nthe act for a while, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I just want this lie of ours\Nto become something real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That would never be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki was out today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How many days is that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Three? Four? I think she's been out all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd text us back if she were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop spacing out! We're talking about Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gotten any texts\Nback from Yoshikawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, she's not texting me, either.\NMaybe she's dealing with family stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We should probably tell her the test\Nis gonna cover different stuff now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.25,0:09:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny would it be if she\Nthrew a tantrum over the test stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno if she'd throw a whole {\i1}tantrum{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she comes tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, you need to go to school already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried about your attendance record?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This girl called Hori-san called.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She said you turned off your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemme guess, you want something again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time you want something,\Nyou never say you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea why you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong or embarrassing\Nabout wanting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need decide\Nif you're going to get it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You always end up\Ncomplaining about it afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a hair clip like hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:11:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki-chan, you just said you didn't want one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want something, then say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had this bad habit forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you stopped making those cookies, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That last batch you did was pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Those pure-white ones, like snow--\Nlike your name. Those were good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure-white, like snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"12 New Messages"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hori: You're out again today. Sick?\NHope you're okay.\NMost classes were self-study today.\NLemme know if you wanna see my notes though."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"Toru: You getting my texts?\NYou're not picking up your phone, either.\NWe're getting worried. At least text us!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hori: I had Miyamura show me how to make\Ncookies today, but my batch came out awful.\NHe ate some anyways, but ended up\Nin the bathroom for an hour... I feel bad!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Toru: Kono-san told me she likes me."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Toru: Kono-san told me she likes me."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Toru: Kono-san told me she likes me."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, did I tell you the test's\Ncovering different stuff now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw your text. This really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's still all stuff\NI'm crap at, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is probably the end\Nof our little game of pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you wanna talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing up here; let's make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give Hori her notebook back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see my text?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. When she told me she liked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me she didn't need an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she doesn't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason she thinks we're dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so she just wanted to get that off her chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell her, then?\NThat we're not dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno. I didn't feel like I had\Nto clear up the misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I promised you I'd play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you didn't have to pretend,\Nwhat would you have told her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Kono-san's way out of my league.\NI wouldn't be good for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll find someone way better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh. Guess that means\Nno more {\i1}sakura {\i0}cookies, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought he'd go for her,\Nwhat with how nice she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't made me any of those\Nburned cookies lately, Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, shut up. I don't burn them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kono-san made him cookies every day,\Nworked up the courage to talk to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and told him how she felt,\Neven knowing she'd be rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But all I do is run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved that he's not going to date her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but the possibility of him\Nnot reciprocating my feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,makes me too scared to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be the one at Toru's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.16,0:16:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's warm Sakura cherry blossoms...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm just gross, muddy,\Nfreezing snow, just like my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear today's gonna be\Nthe coldest day of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's gonna be this cold,\Nit could at least snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't get much snow last year.\NI was looking forward to some this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants it to snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so? It's so pretty, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's pretty, but only in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoveling it's a huge pain,\Nand you can slip and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see Miyamura slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"FLOP"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the gross muddy snow sticks\Naround for so long. Nobody likes {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone just waits for\Nit all to melt in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The snow doesn't melt just because it's spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The snow melts because it\Ndecides to melt on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how badly everyone\Nwants it to stick around,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the snow makes its own decision\Nto melt. That's why it melts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It melts because it gets warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think the snow melts\Nbecause the {\i1}sakura {\i0}blossoms ask it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this guy talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you need to go\Nback to first-grade science.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he can say\Nall that with a straight face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.41,0:18:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so goddamn stupid, Toru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as stupid as you, Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the first time you've smiled all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out here. Let's head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.45,0:18:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And whose bright idea was it\Nto come up here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hand's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope we get some snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The pure-white kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You think Sakura got a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, only because she\Nseems a lot happier as of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm off to tutoring!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the exact opposite\Nof getting a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was she talking about her not being happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The eraser bits on the floor were bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You should let the first-years\Nhandle that! C'mon, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's definitely in better spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost like a weight's off her shoulders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:20:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you should open the\Nwindow if you're going to clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Remi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She had tutoring today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.79,0:20:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi always opens the window.\NThat's why I forgot. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, did something\Nchange for you lately, Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem happier, but I don't think it's\Nbecause something good happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I hope it wasn't anything, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm overthinking this, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I'm heading home.\NSorry I can't help you clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What... What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.95,0:20:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rejected before I even\Nhad a chance to ask him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a moron. He's got to be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the idiot who didn't want to be with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be expelled for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:22:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I ever saw\Nsomeone in my grade break down and sob.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It only hurts more because\Nnobody's in the wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It started snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Next Time: It May Seem Like Hate"
